{"game": "warframe", "language": "english", "appid": 230410, "month": "2013-03", "window": 4, "start_date": 1364083200, "end_date": 1364774399, "month_true_total": 460, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-09-14 18:49:47 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "6554295", "author": {"steamid": "76561198068902069", "personaname": "♡Alessandra♡", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198068902069/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 3, "playtime_forever": 4745, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 116, "last_played": 1622490854, "avatar": "b2732234f3fbed341c241f58e1848418941f7d92"}, "language": "english", "review": "Great free to play co-op third person shooter/slasher. Amazing game.", "timestamp_created": 1364773833, "timestamp_updated": 1364773833, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1364234640", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "120610", "author": {"steamid": "76561197962404358", "personaname": "[borat voice] variks nice", "persona_status": "in-game", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/apants/", "num_games_owned": 920, "num_reviews": 53, "playtime_forever": 1260, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1260, "last_played": 1662797792, "avatar": "e9c5681873425c1f93d1e9b9c051bcaa2ba574e0"}, "language": "english", "review": "I originally played this around launch and remember enjoying it, and every few years they announce that they've reinvented the game, it's good now, so I load it back up to see if it's worth getting into but it never is. Before playing this game, I would recommend watching a few minutes of gameplay on youtube or twitch. See if you can understand what's going on.", "timestamp_created": 1364771531, "timestamp_updated": 1734412991, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1364234640", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "6963184", "author": {"steamid": "76561198080781826", "personaname": "ninjor207", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198080781826/", "num_games_owned": 101, "num_reviews": 74, "playtime_forever": 111922, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 106986, "last_played": 1783866190, "avatar": "5e6fa8ec32a41bb1be8e716cf7f44d54c585112b"}, "language": "english", "review": "At its base Warframe is a hack and slash, looter shooter with Space Ninjas. Set in the far future.\nOver the years additional content has been bolted on including:\nOpen world maps, Star Trek style Space combat, hoverboards, and mechs to name a few.\n\nThis game is in a particularly good spot atm as it has years of content to draw upon,\nplenty of variety in terms of weapons and characters to play as.\nThe story goes deep into Sci-fi, but also has it's emotional moments.\nMusic is distinct going from evoking tranquility to profoundly motivating.\n\nThe current content based upon 1999 and Y2K, is some of the best content DE have created for this game.\n\n", "timestamp_created": 1364768200, "timestamp_updated": 1735499556, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1364234640", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "6582787", "author": {"steamid": "76561198069644104", "personaname": "Cipher", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/NimWasInvalid/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 2, "playtime_forever": 150937, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 33, "playtime_at_review": 91531, "last_played": 1788293146, "avatar": "f5135cc5ca6c05e60b905d86a862d467fff3cd89"}, "language": "english", "review": "I've played a little and it's pretty good", "timestamp_created": 1364765652, "timestamp_updated": 1542827937, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1364234640", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "734078", "author": {"steamid": "76561197976890432", "personaname": "Stadtler", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Stadtler89/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 18, "playtime_forever": 5215, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 345, "last_played": 1682622970, "avatar": "e7d6949a64732d0c33badececcda52c417a4eb76"}, "language": "english", "review": "Great 3rd person f2p shooter in a long time, and its also a much need refresher from the drap that is destiny and destiny 2. If you have not played either this game is very very RPG/Grind heavy but is very satisfying when you get the warframe you have been working for or gun or what not. If you are on the fence its free try it out. I have about 100 hours in the game and have not spent a single dime on the cash store. You have no need to if you are willing to play the game and get the resources you need for the items and frames you want.", "timestamp_created": 1364765541, "timestamp_updated": 1681964061, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1364234640", "reactions": []}]}